    {
      "type": "text", "id": "evidence_text", "x": 1360, "y": 194, "width": 540, "height": 270,
      "text": "真实接口与类型\n\nPOST /v1/chat/completions\nLLM.generate(...)\nAsyncLLM.generate(...)\n\nEngineCoreRequest\nSchedulerOutput\nModelRunnerOutput\nEngineCoreOutputs\n\nRust frontend → 同一个 Python EngineCoreProc", "originalText": "真实接口与类型\n\nPOST /v1/chat/completions\nLLM.generate(...)\nAsyncLLM.generate(...)\n\nEngineCoreRequest\nSchedulerOutput\nModelRunnerOutput\nEngineCoreOutputs\n\nRust frontend → 同一个 Python EngineCoreProc",
      "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 10061,
